config WTK_QMCX983
	bool "QST QMC7983 for MediaTek package (Doogee S88 Pro, from the disassembly)"
	default n
	help
	  QST QMC7983 magnetometer ("qmcX983" in the factory symbols) of the
	  Doogee S88 Pro, reconstructed by reading the disassembled factory
	  kernel. The factory config turns it on (CONFIG_WTK_QMCX983=y); no public
	  tree has the source. See docs/bringup/driver-riscritti.md.
